~ start
#								relative pos		zoom 	time	trans	ease type
#do! CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(750.0, -100.0), 0.5, 3, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")

#							name 	x destination, speed, animate, moonwalk
#do! CutsceneManager.npc_move("Az", 500.0, 		200.0,	 100.0, false, false)
do! CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(-15000,3200), 0.5, 2, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Fenn starry: Whoa! You're [color="B80006"]Az[/color]!! [wave freq=7 amp=30][color="B80006"]Sir Abdullah's[/color] daughter?[/wave]
Az: Dude, I'm a little busy right now.
Fenn: [speed=2]Do you know where the Knights are? I'm Fenn!! [wave freq=7 amp=30]The King invited me to come meet them!![/wave][/speed]
Az: Hmph. Well, [wait=0.3]they're trapped. [i]cough[/i][wait=0.3] Some rookie [color="8A0194"]Wizards[/color] locked them in the Council Chamber.
do EventBus.interrupt_dialogue.emit("0.6")
Fenn worry: What? Wait, does that mean your Dad-
Az annoy: [font_size=60][i]Yes[/i][/font_size], I know. My [color="B80006"]Baba[/color] is trapped too.
Az: [i]cough[/i] The [color="8A0194"]Wizards[/color] scattered all over the castle. I saw one of them go down into the [color="0B4F4A"]Cellar[/color].
Fenn starry: [font_size=60]We have to help them!![wait=0.2] [shake level=10 rate=50 connected=0]ADVENTURE AWAITS!![/shake][/font_size]
Az: No way. I need to  grab something from my [color="0B4F4A"]Workshop[/color]. Stay here til I get back.
Fenn: Hmm... No promises!
Az: Seriously? [wait=0.3][shake level=7 rate=20 connected=0]Ugh[/shake]. Whatever.
do CutsceneManager.npc_move("Az", -16128, 250, true, false)
do CutsceneManager.remove_npc("Az")
do EventFlags.set_flag("Az-Meet-GreatHall", true)
=> END



